{'symbol': 'DUK', 'date': '2021-12-21 09:37:00', 'title': 'PIEDMONT NATURAL GAS SEEKS APPROVAL TO REDUCE CUSTOMER BILLING RATES IN THE CAROLINAS', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C., DEC. 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0PIEDMONT NATURAL GAS LATE LAST WEEK FILED REQUESTS WITH THE UTILITIES COMMISSIONS IN NORTH CAROLINA AND SOUTH CAROLINA TO REDUCE CUSTOMER BILLING RATES DUE TO A DECREASE IN THE MARKET COST OF NATURAL GAS.'}